### SmartAdmin 示例宿主 —— 字典
# 前置顺序:字典项挂在字典类型的 code 上,所以必须先建类型、再加项。删类型会级联删掉它下面的全部项。
# 管理端点是 [RolePermission];只有 items/{typeCode}(前端下拉热路径)降成 [ActiveSession]。

@host = http://localhost:5100
@account = superAdmin
@password = <粘贴首启控制台打印的随机密码>

### 登录 —— 先跑这条
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "{{account}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 分页查询字典类型 —— 种子播了 common_status / org_category / gender
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sys/dict/type/page?current=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 第一步:新增字典类型 —— code 创建后不可变(更新时会被忽略)
# @name addDictType
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/dict/type
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "demo_status",
  "name": "示例状态",
  "sort": 9,
  "enabled": true,
  "remark": "http 样例建出来的字典类型"
}

### 第二步:往这个类型下加字典项 —— dictTypeCode 填上一步的 code,不是 Id
# @name addDictItem
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/dict/item
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dictTypeCode": "demo_status",
  "label": "草稿",
  "value": "draft",
  "sort": 1,
  "enabled": true
}

### 再加一项
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/dict/item
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dictTypeCode": "demo_status",
  "label": "已发布",
  "value": "published",
  "sort": 2,
  "enabled": true
}

### 按类型取启用中的项 —— 前端下拉的数据源,读穿透缓存
# 改完字典项想立刻看到效果,缓存没跟上就跑 ops.http 里的「清字典缓存」
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sys/dict/items/demo_status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 分页查询字典项(管理端:含停用项,不走缓存)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sys/dict/item/page?typeCode=demo_status&current=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 更新字典项
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/sys/dict/item/{{addDictItem.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dictTypeCode": "demo_status",
  "label": "草稿(已改)",
  "value": "draft",
  "sort": 1,
  "enabled": false
}

### 更新字典类型 —— 只有 name/sort/enabled/remark 生效,code 传了也不改
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/sys/dict/type/{{addDictType.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "demo_status",
  "name": "示例状态(已改名)",
  "sort": 8,
  "enabled": true,
  "remark": null
}

### 删除字典项
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/sys/dict/item/{{addDictItem.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 删除字典类型 —— 级联删掉它下面剩余的全部项
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/sys/dict/type/{{addDictType.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 批量删除字典类型(各自级联删项)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/dict/type/batch-delete
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": []
}
